  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [webpack-dev-server](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server) from `v2.9.7` to `v2.11.2`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v2.10.0`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/releases/v2.10.0)\n\nVersion 2.10.0 adds the transpilation of the client scripts via babel to ES5 which restores backwards compatibility (that was removed in 2.8.0) to very old or out of date browsers. \n\n**Important** webpack-dev-server has entered a maintenance-only mode. We won't be accepting any new features or major modifications. We'll still welcome pull requests for fixes however, and will continue to address any bugs that arise. Announcement with specifics pending.\n#### Bugfixes\n\n- iOS Safari 10 bug where SockJS couldn't be found (#&#8203;1238)\n- `reportTime` option (#&#8203;1209)\n- don't mutate stats configuration (#&#8203;1174)\n- enable progress from config (#&#8203;1181)\n#### Updates\n\n- transpile client bundles with babel (#&#8203;1242)\n- dependency updates (ce30460)\n- Increase minimum `marked` version for ReDos vuln (#&#8203;1255)\n- Update sockjs dependency to fix auditjs security vulnerability warning\n\n---\n\n### [`v2.11.0`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/releases/v2.11.0)\n\nVersion 2.11.0 adds the transpilation of the client scripts via babel to ES5 which restores backwards compatibility (that was removed in 2.8.0) to very old or out of date browsers.\n\n---\n\n### [`v2.11.1`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/releases/v2.11.1)\n\nOur third attempt to fix compatibility with old browsers (#&#8203;1273), this time we'll get it right.\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v2.10.0\n-   [`e8964d1`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/e8964d1cba25f69ab290f6f9f51c63ef262aad6b) add --progress cli test (#&#8203;1182)\n-   [`7e89442`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/7e89442316dba2174a131e0d4d1c90a24cdb0c18) enable progress from config (#&#8203;1181)\n-   [`ef18fc8`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/ef18fc86a3e72577e69d527138906b266adb30f5) Update sockjs dependency to fix auditjs security vulnerability warning (#&#8203;1178)\n-   [`32c3ceb`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/32c3cebb54e32527ebf45ff55b4ce5ed05d32544) don&#x27;t mutate stats configuration (#&#8203;1174)\n-   [`a168b81`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/a168b812e4aeedaa1d76419056ec2a50fd2e74a6) feat: `reportTime` option (#&#8203;1209)\n-   [`aab49de`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/aab49de98972e54e50a0c3ceda587e6a89540ee3) iOS Safari 10 bug where SockJS couldn&#x27;t be found (#&#8203;1238)\n-   [`c9c61f2`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/c9c61f27e3ba209222ee2834ea8c6d7aa7ffd14c) fix(package): Increase minimum `marked` version for ReDos vuln (#&#8203;1255)\n-   [`082ddae`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/082ddae5d38299c64a6144ce6f02bdc26604b4c9) maint only mode\n-   [`00e8500`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/00e8500b0853312be3cf369976509fbce2a4b7dc) updating deps and patching as necessary\n-   [`ce30460`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/ce30460229ed5766c964061595bf39689a1f9ea0) rolling back webpack-dev-midddleware 2.0, as it&#x27;s node6+\n-   [`17355f0`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/17355f0aee97119eb15e340087ee643bc0d928ef) transpile client bundles with babel (#&#8203;1242)\n-   [`ca8b5aa`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/ca8b5aa689220ce70d3fd6db8bfcfa62b1fa14f4) 2.10.0 (#&#8203;1258)\n#### v2.10.1\n-   [`aaf7fce`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/aaf7fcef01425bdf435a9998e2ccc0e28c3a4aec) rollback yargs to 6.6.0\n-   [`3e220fe`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/3e220fe1c9dcdc7b688090f0f4661e06a1e87c91) 2.10.1\n#### v2.11.0\n-   [`6689cb8`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/6689cb83cf8305ba1f600972487cb223552099d8) adding test for dependency lock-down\n-   [`449494f`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/449494fee92c7f8173a40017270c1ff927debef4) cleanup client build setup\n-   [`676d590`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/676d5906c0f74d9335f640912c4f9fa58578b94b) revert to prepublish (fix ci)\n-   [`b0fa5f6`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/b0fa5f634e82ce942ac79f1b1371ef7f5afcdc81) Merge pull request #&#8203;1270 from yyx990803/client-refactor\n-   [`8c1ed7a`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/8c1ed7aad263f6a7b850e63cf945388ddac84441) 2.11.0\n#### v2.11.1\n-   [`b78e249`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/b78e249c7953f4a7676ec0f32990777edf45c01e) fix: pin strip-ansi to 3.x for ES5 compat\n-   [`3aa15aa`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/3aa15aa619e1b54cc8ddb8ea2be897d4266527bb) Merge pull request #&#8203;1273 from yyx990803/master\n-   [`83c1625`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/83c16251a16794b61fa22761d43b6450bfb18207) 2.11.1\n#### v2.11.2\n-   [`9934724`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/99347244a49ed2fb9b4d069c851a4a11a7accc8f) Fix accidental skip of nearly all tests (whoops)\n-   [`31d94ab`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/31d94ab83ca672542e7c74f5c5c00c89a6ff64e3) Make tests use more webpack 4 goodiness\n-   [`c32cfa8`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/c32cfa8c01c89a6f35e971c3330d4fe5fb49df5a) Use non-deprecated webpack 4 API&#x27;s\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
